---
// YouTube & Audio Downloader Component
---

<div class="downloader-app">


  <!-- Vercel Navigation Bar -->
  <nav class="nav-bar">
    <div class="nav-container">
      <div class="nav-left">
        <a href="/" class="nav-logo">
          <img src="/favicon-96x96.png" alt="Y2mate Logo" width="24" height="24" />
          <span class="logo-name">Y2mate</span>
          <span class="logo-domain-mono">audio.com</span>
        </a>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="#features" class="nav-link" data-t="nav_features">Features</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="nav-link" data-t="nav_how">How it Works</a>
          <a href="#history" class="nav-link" data-t="nav_history">History</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="nav-link" data-t="nav_faq">FAQ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-right">
        <!-- Language Dropdown -->
        <div class="btn-lang-selector-container">
          <button class="btn-lang-toggle" id="btn-lang-toggle" aria-label="Select Language">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
              <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span id="current-lang-code" style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase;">EN</span>
          </button>
          <div class="lang-dropdown hidden" id="lang-dropdown">
            <button data-lang="hi">हिन्दी</button>
            <button data-lang="en" class="active">English</button>
            <button data-lang="ta">தமிழ்</button>
            <button data-lang="te">తెలుగు</button>
            <button data-lang="ml">മലയാളം</button>
            <button data-lang="es">Español</button>
            <button data-lang="fr">Français</button>
            <button data-lang="de">Deutsch</button>
            <button data-lang="it">Italiano</button>
            <button data-lang="pt">Português</button>
            <button data-lang="ru">Русский</button>
            <button data-lang="id">Bahasa Indonesia</button>
            <button data-lang="ja">日本語</button>
            <button data-lang="zh">简体中文</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <button class="btn-sound-toggle" id="btn-sound-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Sound">
          <svg id="sound-icon-on" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="display: block;">
            <polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"></polygon>
            <path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07"></path>
          </svg>
          <svg id="sound-icon-off" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="display: none;">
            <polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"></polygon>
            <line x1="23" y1="9" x2="17" y2="15"></line>
            <line x1="17" y1="9" x2="23" y2="15"></line>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="btn-theme-toggle" id="btn-theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Theme">
          <svg id="theme-icon-sun" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="display: none;">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"></circle>
            <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
            <line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"></line>
            <line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"></line>
            <line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"></line>
            <line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"></line>
            <line x1="4.22" y1="19.78" x2="5.64" y2="18.36"></line>
            <line x1="18.36" y1="5.64" x2="19.78" y2="4.22"></line>
          </svg>
          <svg id="theme-icon-moon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="display: block;">
            <path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <span class="caption-mono secure-badge">
          <span class="secure-dot"></span>
          <span data-t="nav_secure">SECURE</span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <button class="nav-hamburger" id="nav-hamburger" aria-label="Open menu">
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Mobile Side Drawer Navigation -->
  <div class="mobile-drawer" id="mobile-drawer">
    <div class="drawer-header">
      <span class="caption-mono" data-t="nav_navigation">Navigation</span>
      <button class="drawer-close" id="drawer-close">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="drawer-links">
      <a href="#features" class="drawer-link" data-t="nav_features">Features</a>
      <a href="#how-it-works" class="drawer-link" data-t="nav_how">How it Works</a>
      <a href="#history" class="drawer-link" data-t="nav_history">History</a>
      <a href="#faq" class="drawer-link" data-t="nav_faq">FAQ</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="drawer-backdrop" id="drawer-backdrop"></div>

  <!-- Hero Landing Section -->
  <section class="hero-band">
    <div class="mesh-gradient"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="caption-mono section-eyebrow" data-t="hero_eyebrow">YouTube to MP3 Converter</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title" data-t="hero_title">Download videos and audios at the speed of thought.</h1>
      <p class="hero-body" data-t="hero_body">Convert YouTube videos directly to premium MP3 audio or MP4 video files. Completely ad-free, secure, and running with dynamic format detection.</p>
      
      <!-- Interactive Search Box -->
      <div class="search-container">
        <div class="search-box">
          <input 
            type="text" 
            id="url-input" 
            class="search-input" 
            placeholder="Paste YouTube link or type keywords to search..."
            data-placeholder-t="search_placeholder"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <button id="search-btn" class="search-btn" aria-label="Search or Convert">
            <span class="btn-text" data-t="search_btn">Search</span>
            <div class="btn-spinner hidden"></div>
          </button>
        </div>
        <!-- Autocomplete Dropdown List -->
        <div class="suggestions-dropdown hidden" id="suggestions-dropdown"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Loading State -->
      <div id="loading-state" class="loading-state hidden">
        <dotlottie-player src="/Lodinganimation/Loading%20animation%20blue.lottie" background="transparent" speed="1" class="loading-video" loop autoplay renderer="svg" style="width: 240px; height: 240px; max-width: 100%;"></dotlottie-player>
        <p class="caption-mono text-muted" data-t="loading_msg">Analyzing media streams from YouTube...</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Error State -->
      <div id="error-state" class="error-state hidden">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
          <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
          <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line>
        </svg>
        <p id="error-message" data-t="error_invalid">Please enter a valid YouTube URL or search query</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- YouTube Search Results Grid Section -->
  <section id="search-results-section" class="search-results-band hidden">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
        <span class="caption-mono">Search Results</span>
        <h2 class="display-lg" style="font-size: 28px; line-height: 34px;">Select a video to convert</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="search-results-grid" id="search-results-grid">
        <!-- Rendered dynamically by javascript -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Interactive Results & Visual Player Section -->
  <section id="results-section" class="results-band hidden">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="results-grid">
        
        <!-- Left Side: Interactive Video Player Mockup -->
        <div class="video-preview-column">
          <div class="browser-mockup">
            <div class="browser-header">
              <div class="browser-dots">
                <span class="dot dot-red"></span>
                <span class="dot dot-yellow"></span>
                <span class="dot dot-green"></span>
              </div>
              <span class="browser-address" id="browser-url-label">youtube.com</span>
            </div>
            <div class="video-player-container">
              <!-- Inline YouTube Iframe Embed -->
              <iframe 
                id="preview-iframe" 
                src="" 
                title="YouTube Video Preview" 
                frameborder="0" 
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" 
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
            <div class="video-meta-details">
              <h3 id="video-title" class="video-title"></h3>
              <p id="video-channel" class="video-channel"></p>
              <div class="video-stats-row">
                <span class="stat-item" id="video-duration">
                  <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                    <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
                  </svg>
                  <span id="txt-duration">0:00</span>
                </span>
                <span class="stat-item" id="video-views">
                  <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
                  </svg>
                  <span id="txt-views">0 views</span>
                </span>
                <span class="stat-item" id="video-likes">
                  <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M14 9V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3l-4 9v11h11.28a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.7l1.38-9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2.3zM7 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <span id="txt-likes">0 likes</span>
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Side: Format Quality Options & Real-Time Download Box -->
        <div class="download-options-column">
          <div class="options-card">
            <!-- Format Tabs -->
            <div class="format-tabs">
              <button class="format-tab active" data-format="video" data-t="tab_video">
                Video (MP4)
              </button>
              <button class="format-tab" data-format="audio" data-t="tab_audio">
                Audio (MP3)
              </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Dynamic Video Quality List -->
            <div id="video-options" class="quality-list">
              <!-- Injected by script -->
            </div>

            <!-- Dynamic Audio Quality List -->
            <div id="audio-options" class="quality-list hidden">
              <!-- Injected by script -->
            </div>

            <!-- Custom Progress Feedback -->
            <div id="download-progress" class="download-progress hidden">
              <div class="progress-info-row">
                <span class="progress-status" id="progress-text">Preparing download...</span>
                <span class="progress-percentage" id="progress-percent">0%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="progress-track">
                <div class="progress-fill" id="progress-fill"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Download History Section -->
  <section id="history" class="history-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="caption-mono" data-t="history_caption">Local Dashboard</span>
        <h2 class="display-lg" data-t="history_title">Your recent downloads.</h2>
        <p class="section-desc text-muted" data-t="history_desc">All files converted on this device are saved in your local history for quick access.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="history-card">
        <div class="history-table-wrapper">
          <table class="history-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th class="col-title" data-t="th_video">Video</th>
                <th class="col-action" data-t="th_action">Action</th>
                <th class="col-quality" data-t="th_quality">Quality</th>
                <th class="col-type" data-t="th_format">Format</th>
                <th class="col-date" data-t="th_date">Date</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="history-rows">
              <tr>
                <td colspan="5" class="empty-state text-muted" data-t="empty_history">
                  No files downloaded yet. Search a video to get started.
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Product Features Section -->
  <section id="features" class="features-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="caption-mono font-mono" data-t="adv_caption">Advantages</span>
        <h2 class="display-lg" data-t="adv_title">A better downloading experience.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="card-marketing">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="f1_title">100% Ad-Free & Safe</h3>
          <p class="body-md" data-t="f1_body">Unlike competitor sites, we have zero redirects, popup advertisements, or deceptive buttons. Your safety is our priority.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-marketing">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="f2_title">DASH Audio & Video Muxing</h3>
          <p class="body-md" data-t="f2_body">YouTube separates audio and video streams for 1080p+. Our background engine merges them back together into single MP4s.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-marketing">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon>
              <polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline>
              <polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="f3_title">Dynamic Formats</h3>
          <p class="body-md" data-t="f3_body">Instead of displaying hardcoded qualities that fail, we scan YouTube formats dynamically for every single video request.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-marketing">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="f4_title">Premium MP3 Bitrates</h3>
          <p class="body-md" data-t="f4_body">Convert video streams into standard high-quality MP3 audio files (up to 320kbps) with seamless browser file-saving.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works Section -->
  <section id="how-it-works" class="how-it-works-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="caption-mono" data-t="steps_caption">Instructions</span>
        <h2 class="display-lg" data-t="steps_title">Simple conversion flow.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="steps-row">
        <div class="step-col">
          <div class="step-indicator">1</div>
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="step1_title">Search or Paste</h3>
          <p class="body-sm" data-t="step1_body">Paste a YouTube link directly, or type search terms in the box. Click Search.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-col">
          <div class="step-indicator">2</div>
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="step2_title">Select Quality</h3>
          <p class="body-sm" data-t="step2_body">Preview the video using the embedded browser mockup. Select the audio or video quality format.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-col">
          <div class="step-indicator">3</div>
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="step3_title">Download File</h3>
          <p class="body-sm" data-t="step3_body">Wait for our servers to download and mux the file. Save the download directly to your device.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section id="faq" class="faq-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="caption-mono" data-t="faq_caption">Faq</span>
        <h2 class="display-lg" data-t="faq_title">Frequently Asked Questions.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-grid">
        <div class="faq-card">
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="q1">Is there any limit to the number of downloads?</h3>
          <p class="body-sm text-muted" data-t="a1">No, Y2mateAudioDownloader offers unlimited downloading and conversions completely free of charge.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-card">
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="q2">Where are downloaded files saved?</h3>
          <p class="body-sm text-muted" data-t="a2">Downloaded files are saved in your device's default "Downloads" folder or the path selected in your browser settings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-card">
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="q3">Do I need to register an account?</h3>
          <p class="body-sm text-muted" data-t="a3">No registration, login, or software installation is required. Everything runs directly inside your web browser.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-card">
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="q4">Are high resolution downloads supported?</h3>
          <p class="body-sm text-muted" data-t="a4">Yes. If the source video supports 1080p, 1440p, or 4K resolutions, our downloader will fetch and package the file in full resolution.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-card">
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="q5">How to download YouTube videos using Y2mate?</h3>
          <p class="body-sm text-muted" data-t="a5">Downloading YouTube videos with Y2mate is fast and simple. First, copy the YouTube video link from your browser or app. Paste the link into the search input box at the top of Y2mate. Select your desired output quality (such as 1080p, 720p, or 320kbps MP3) and format, then click the download button. The conversion starts immediately, and you can save the file directly to your device.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-card">
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="q6">Is Y2mate safe and legit to use?</h3>
          <p class="body-sm text-muted" data-t="a6">Yes, Y2mate is safe, legitimate, and secure when accessed through clean, ad-free versions like ours. Many user discussions on platforms like Reddit highlight that the main risk of traditional online video converters comes from malicious advertisements and redirects. Our Y2mate platform is 100% ad-free, runs directly in your browser without requiring any software installation, registration, or unsafe browser extensions, ensuring your device remains completely protected.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-card">
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="q7">Is using Y2mate legal?</h3>
          <p class="body-sm text-muted" data-t="a7">Using Y2mate to download and convert public YouTube videos for personal offline use, fair use, or educational purposes is generally considered safe and standard. However, downloading copyrighted music or video content without the creator's permission may violate the platform's terms of service. We recommend downloading videos that you own or have permission to use.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-card">
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="q8">Are there Y2mate MP3 download apps for Android?</h3>
          <p class="body-sm text-muted" data-t="a8">You do not need to download or install a separate Y2mate app to convert YouTube videos on mobile. Y2mate is fully responsive and optimized for mobile browsers. You can perform high-speed MP3 and MP4 downloads directly through Chrome, Firefox, or any other web browser on your Android device with no installation required, keeping your phone safe from malware.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-card">
          <h3 class="display-sm" data-t="q9">What is the Y2mate MP4 Player and is there a free download?</h3>
          <p class="body-sm text-muted" data-t="a9">Y2mate is primarily a web-based video downloader and converter rather than a dedicated media player software. You do not need to perform any "Y2mate MP4 Player free download" because any video or audio file downloaded from Y2mate is saved in standard formats (such as MP4 and MP3) which can be played instantly on your device's native media player, VLC, or any free default app on Windows, macOS, Android, and iOS.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SEO Content Section -->
  <section class="seo-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="seo-content-wrapper">
        <h2>Y2mate: The Ultimate YouTube to MP3 Converter & Video Downloader</h2>
        
        <p>
          In today's digital era, streaming high-definition music and video content has become an integral part of our daily lives. Whether you are building offline playlists for your commute, saving educational tutorials for study sessions, or curating high-quality soundtracks, having a reliable tool is essential. Enter <strong>Y2mate</strong>, the premier online destination for downloading and converting video streams. Our platform operates as a powerful <strong>y2mate video downloader</strong> and high-speed audio extractor, enabling users to seamlessly perform a <strong>y2mate download</strong> of their favorite content from YouTube and other streaming sites without cost or limitations. We are proud to provide a seamless user interface designed to maximize speed, security, and responsive performance across all platforms.
